Dark industrial wallpaper texture for a phone app background, portrait. An almost black surface of worn forged steel plate with very subtle diamond tread pattern, fine scratches and faint oil stains. Extremely low contrast and very dark overall, so that white text placed on top stays easy to read. A faint warm orange glow along the bottom edge, soft and dim, like distant furnace light. No objects, no buttons, no bolts in the middle, no text, no logos, no warning stripes, no people. Flat, even, front-on, like a material sample.
